{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876160/extras/69c0aaa4710e89c62545705fd9afdc98.poster.avif?t=1758158119\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876160/extras/69c0aaa4710e89c62545705fd9afdc98.webm?t=1758158119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876160/extras/69c0aaa4710e89c62545705fd9afdc98.mp4?t=1758158119\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Join Flare, the grooviest bounty hunter, on her quest to snag the mansion of her dreams. But there\u2019s a catch: She\u2019ll have to track down, fight and burn up the most notorious criminals and take on the tyrannical ruler of the land, Ms. Swing.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876160/extras/270bb8059bb108da9644ecdbd0147965.avif?t=1758158119\" width=300 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876160/extras/0b2dc36252357c5bf7bab69c4f28768a.avif?t=1758158119\" width=341 height=89 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run, Kick, and Burn</strong> \u2013 Fight your way through <strong>8 fast-paced levels</strong> packed with high-octane action!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-Drawn Cartoon Style</strong> \u2013 Enter a world inspired by C<strong>lassic Saturday Morning Cartoons </strong>(Looney Tunes, Ren &amp; Stimpy, etc.), brought to life with expressive, hand-drawn animation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Insane Moveset</strong> \u2013 Unleash fiery kicks, <strong>hair attacks</strong>, and unpredictable combos to scorch everything in your path!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over The Top Boss Fights</strong> \u2013 Square off against <strong>wacky, larger-than-life villains</strong> with bizarre gimmicks and ridiculous attacks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secrets &amp; Surprises</strong> \u2013 Unearth power-ups, bonus challenges and unexpected twists that keep every level full of crazy discoveries!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><strong>\u201cTurn up the funk, turn up the fire \u2014\u2019cause <i>Dynamite Flare</i> is on the wire!\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876160/extras/0d4132b934bff0530c5e85f8341a5873.poster.avif?t=1758158119\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876160/extras/0d4132b934bff0530c5e85f8341a5873.webm?t=1758158119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876160/extras/0d4132b934bff0530c5e85f8341a5873.mp4?t=1758158119\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2876160?t=1758158119","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2876160?t=1758158119","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876160/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758158119","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876160/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758158119","ca