 with high-octane action!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-Drawn Cartoon Style</strong> \u2013 Enter a world inspired by C<strong>lassic Saturday Morning Cartoons </strong>(Looney Tunes, Ren &amp; Stimpy, etc.), brought to life with expressive, hand-drawn animation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Insane Moveset</strong> \u2013 Unleash fiery kicks, <strong>hair attacks</strong>, and unpredictable combos to scorch everything in your path!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over The Top Boss Fights</strong> \u2013 Square off against <strong>wacky, larger-than-life villains</strong> with bizarre gimmicks and ridiculous attacks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secrets &amp; Surprises</strong> \u2013 Unearth power-ups, bonus challenges and unexpected twists that keep every level full of crazy discoveries!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><strong>\u201cTurn up the funk, turn up the fire \u2014\u2019cause <i>Dynamite Flare</i> is on the wire!\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876160/extras/0d4132b934bff0530c5e85f8341a5873.poster.avif?t=1758158119\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876160/extras/0d4132b934bff0530c5e85f8341a5873.webm?t=1758158119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876160/extras/0d4132b934bff0530c5e85f8341a5873.mp4?t=1758158119\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Slicky Grease Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor